/-
  Unicode.Generated.EmojiDataRows

  Materialized emoji-data property rows (UTS #51 17.0.0), pinned as a
  `List` literal so the per-property range tables and lookups reduce in
  the kernel. The parser and `include_str` source live in
  `Unicode.Generated.EmojiData`, which imports this module and carries
  the build-time drift gate.
-/

namespace Unicode.Generated.EmojiData

set_option maxRecDepth 1000000

